Pencil Echo is an independent native iPad project based on PenEcho
(Copyright (C) 2026 PenEcho authors and contributors, AGPL-3.0-only).
Files ported from PenEcho carry a provenance header naming the upstream
file and commit (341e34d); docs/reuse-inventory.md lists them. Pencil Echo
is not an official PenEcho release and is not endorsed by the PenEcho
project. It uses none of the PenEcho name, wordmark, logo or pen-nib mark
as its own identity; see the upstream TRADEMARKS.md.

Third-party software
--------------------

SwiftMath 1.7.3 (https://github.com/mgriebling/SwiftMath), MIT License,
is used to render LaTeX. Its license is bundled at
application/App/Resources/ThirdPartyNotices/SwiftMath-LICENSE.txt and shown
in the app under AI Settings > About > Third-party notices.
